meta {
  name: 09 Security Checks
  seq: 10
}

docs {
  # Security checks (OWASP API Security Top 10, 2023)
  Not a penetration test. These are cheap checks you keep in the suite, so a change that breaks a security rule fails the build.
  Gaps these checks cannot fix on their own, and how to show them:
  - No rate limit on login (API4): run "03 Negative Tests / Wrong Password" in the Runner with 25 iterations. Every attempt gets 401, none gets 429.
  - No length limit on title (API4): a 50,000 character title is accepted.
}
